{
  "info": {
    "name": "Cenomi AI v2 — Service Request Chatbot API",
    "description": "Full API surface of service-request-chatbot/backend.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import `cenomi-ai-v2.postman_environment.json` and select it.\n2. Set `baseUrl` (default http://localhost:8000).\n3. Run **Auth → Login** first — its test script stores the JWT in the environment; every other folder uses it automatically.\n\nSeed users (scripts/seed_users.py, password `test1234`):\n- aisha@cenomi.com — MALL_MANAGER\n- khalid@cenomi.com — FM_MANAGER\n- omar@cenomi.com — OPERATIONS\n- sara@cenomi.com — DD_ENGINEER\n- admin@cenomi.com — ADMIN (required for the Indexer folder when RBAC_ENFORCE=true)\n\nThe MSP Help-Agent folder additionally sends the `x-internal-api-token` header from `{{mspServiceToken}}` — only needed when MSP_SERVICE_TOKEN is set on the server.\n\nv2 paths (/api/v2/...) mirror v1 for chat/auth/upload/observability; requests here use the canonical paths each consumer is pinned to.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe — no auth.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/ready",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "ready"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Readiness probe — checks DB connectivity.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Reset mock SR state (dev only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dev/mock/reset",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "dev",
                "mock",
                "reset"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Resets the in-memory mock platform SR store. Dev environments only.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Mall Manager)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Stores access_token into {{jwt}} via test script.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"aisha@cenomi.com\",\n  \"password\": \"test1234\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set('jwt', data.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('jwt saved to environment');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('login ok', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
